          },
          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" mbr-paddings class=\"mbr-section article content3\">\n      \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) --> \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#a84a17\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->     \n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"row col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-12': cardsAmount == 1, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\">\n                     <p><b>La excelencia de una obra comienza con la calidad de sus componentes.</b> Entendemos que para construir infraestructuras seguras, duraderas y de alto impacto, se requiere un acceso confiable a materiales de primer nivel.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                     <p>Nuestro compromiso es ser la solución integral que garantiza la eficiencia en cada fase constructiva. Más que un simple proveedor, somos un garante de calidad que asegura que cada bloque, herramienta y equipo cumpla con los más altos estándares, ofreciendo la flexibilidad y el respaldo que su inversión merece.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                     <p>Make your own website in a few clicks! Mobirise helps you cut down development time by providing you with a flexible website editor with a drag and drop interface. Mobirise Website Builder creates responsive, retina and mobile friendly websites in a few clicks. Mobirise is one of the easiest website development tools available today. It also gives you the freedom to develop as many websites as you like given the fact that it is a desktop app.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content3-11",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "uNY1nkwccW",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              ".card-box": {
                "padding": "1rem 2rem 2rem"
              }
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding": "1rem 2rem 2rem"
              }
            },
            "h4": {
              "font-weight": "500",
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "text-align": "left",
              "padding-top": "2rem"
            },
            "p": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "text-align": "left",
              "padding-top": "1.5rem",
              "& when not (@showTitle)": {
                "padding-top": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "padding-top": "2.5rem",
              "a": {
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "height": "100%",
              "& when not (@transparentBg)": {
                "background": "@cardsBg",
                ".card-box": {
                  "padding": "0 2rem 2rem"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".card:not(.last-child)": {
                "padding-bottom": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#232323"
            }
          },
          "_name": "services1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"services1\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <!---->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <!---->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Card Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Card Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent BG\" name=\"transparentBg\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards Bg\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentBg\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <select title=\"Align Buttons:\" name=\"alignBtn\" condition=\"showButtons\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">Center</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <!---->\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background2.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <!---->\n    <!--Overlay-->\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <!--Container-->\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <!--Titles-->\n            <div class=\"title pb-5 col-12\">\n                <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-left pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n                    Our Shop\n                </h2>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Subtitle\n                </h3>\n            </div>\n            <!--Card-1-->\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6 p-3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'last-child': cardsAmount == '1'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-gc6ofsgc6ofsgc6o-696x696.png\" alt=\"Fabricación y Venta de Materiales Estructurales\" title=\"Fabricación y Venta de Materiales Estructurales\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Fabricación y Venta de Materiales Estructurales</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Nos dedicamos a la fabricación, distribución y venta de bloques y materiales estructurales  pensados para dar vida a obras seguras y duraderas. Garantizamos que cada producto está estrictamente ajustado a los estándares de calidad exigidos por la industria, ofreciendo una base sólida y confiable para su proyecto.\n                        </p>\n                        <!--Btn-->\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-class=\"{'align-left' : alignBtn == 1, 'align-center' : alignBtn == 2, 'align-right' : alignBtn == 3}\"><a href=\"https://wa.link/aitahr\" class=\"btn btn-info\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Solicitar Cotización</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!--Card-2-->\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6 p-3\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'last-child': cardsAmount == '2'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-64lfn464lfn464lf-696x696.png\" alt=\"Venta de Maquinaria y Herramientas Especializadas\" title=\"Venta de Maquinaria y Herramientas Especializadas\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Venta de Maquinaria y Herramientas Especializadas</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Ofrecemos la comercialización especializada de maquinaria y herramientas de alto rendimiento, seleccionadas para potenciar la eficiencia y la precisión en el sector de la construcción e industrial. Nuestro catálogo está diseñado para equipar sus proyectos con la tecnología necesaria para lograr resultados de alto impacto  y confiabilidad.\n                        </p>\n                        <!--Btn-->\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-class=\"{'align-left' : alignBtn == 1, 'align-center' : alignBtn == 2, 'align-right' : alignBtn == 3}\"><a href=\"https://wa.link/cbfdyl\" class=\"btn btn-info\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Solicitar Cotización</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!--Card-3-->\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6 p-3\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'last-child': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-7f6ba57f6ba57f6b-696x696.png\" alt=\"Suministros de Ferretería y Materiales Generales\" title=\"Suministros de Ferretería y Materiales Generales\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Suministros de Ferretería y Materiales Generales</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Ponemos a su disposición una solución integral con nuestro extenso catálogo de productos, equipos de ferretería y materiales para la construcción. Con modalidades de venta flexibles, tanto al por mayor como al detal, aseguramos un suministro completo y oportuno para acompañar cada detalle de su obra hasta su culminación.</p>\n                        <!--Btn-->\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-class=\"{'align-left' : alignBtn == 1, 'align-center' : alignBtn == 2, 'align-right' : alignBtn == 3}\"><a href=\"https://wa.link/btw5of\" class=\"btn btn-info\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                Solicitar Cotización</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!--Card-4-->\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6 p-3\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'last-child': cardsAmount == '4'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/product1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            Watch Strict\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Ab accusantium dolores doloribus\n                            eligendi eum illo placeat quis repellendus sequi tempore!\n                        </p>\n                        <!--Btn-->\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-class=\"{'align-left' : alignBtn == 1, 'align-center' : alignBtn == 2, 'align-right' : alignBtn == 3}\">\n                            <a href=\"https://mobirise.co\" class=\"btn btn-warning-outline\">\n                                $ 790\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "services1-12",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "uNY1nYGtZs",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
